<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech 39-week t-bills gross yield hits 17.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Czech 39-week t-bills gross yield hits 17.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gross yield in a Czech National Bank (CNB) auction of a six-billion tranche of Finance Ministry 39-week T-bills reached 17.1 percent, the CNB said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Net yield was 12.825 percent, the CNB said.</p>
